  "solution": {
    "text": "Here 6 H-atoms are acidic enough to react with <math><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>⊖</mo></mrow></mover></math> for R-MgX.<br />Here hydrogen atom of <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> (phenolic and alcoholic both) and <math> <mtable columnalign='left'>  <mtr>   <mtd>    <mo>&#x2212;</mo><mtext>CH</mtext><mo>&#x2212;</mo><msub>     <mtext>NO</mtext>     <mtext>2</mtext>    </msub>       </mtd>  </mtr>  <mtr>   <mtd>    <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>&#x007C;</mtext>   </mtd>  </mtr>  <mtr>   <mtd>    <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msub>     <mtext>NO</mtext>     <mtext>2</mtext>    </msub>       </mtd>  </mtr> </mtable> </math> are acidic.<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0012_b50495881af2.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.25833in;height:1.94167in\" />"
  }
